
COMPILE name[.cy[,drv]] [/x]
  name:    file name of program to compile
  x:       l,p: no hard copy print
           r: range checking for index
           n: no loader file
  Default drive is 1.

Compiler directives:
  {$I filename}  include file
  {$R-) {$R+}    range checking, default false
  {$U-} {$U+}    unique identifiers in scope
